+# AyuGram iOS Port Status — 1.4.0
+
+## Implemented
+- Per-account AyuGram settings persistence
+- Ghost Mode policy and hooks for read, story-read, presence, upload-progress and message-view paths
+- Deleted-message capture before Postbox deletion
+- Incoming edit-history capture before Postbox replacement
+- Postbox-native AyuGram history state with duplicate suppression and scoped clearing
+- Regex filter engine and chat history filter gate
+- Message Shot context-menu action for text and media-only messages
+- Display-only Zalgo / bidi sanitizer
+- Custom edited mark setting
+- Translation provider selector setting
+- Provider-backed Google/Yandex translation service through Telegram's optional internal translation hook
+- Message bubble tail visibility control
+- Message-shot appearance controls surfaced in AyuGram settings
+
+## Not yet validated in this environment
+- Full Xcode build against a selected iOS SDK
+- Device installation / signing / IPA archive
+- Live network behavior on physical iOS devices
+- Provider rate limits and endpoint availability
+- Full-fidelity media rasterization for Message Shot
+- Visual regression testing across all Telegram bubble layouts
+
+## 1.3.0
+
+- Integrated regex filters into TelegramUI text rendering for incoming messages.
+- Preserves outgoing messages and keeps original Telegram message text untouched.
+- Applies per-dialog rules before shared rules and respects shared-filter exclusions.
+- Restricts chat filtering unless `filtersEnabledInChats` is enabled; broadcast channels remain eligible.
+- Compiles regular expressions once per account/settings snapshot and reuses the engine during message rendering.
+
+- Corrected filter eligibility in chat history: outgoing messages are preserved, and shared filters apply to broadcast channels.
